[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_dx63b"]
script = ExtResource("6_7yudu")
markedup_text = "Question the cat."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_fhdq1")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_nrw5p")
markedup_result_text = "The apothecary demands to know how the cat is able to speak.

The cat only grins in response. Its shadow, dancing upon the wall in the firelight, keeps growing until it towers over her menacingly.

The woman backs away from the dark spirit, huddling in the corner of the hut. She recites chants until dawn, when sleep finally overcomes her."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_aqvio"]
script = ExtResource("12_ytmls")
relic = ExtResource("11_13pxk")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://c72da5id7avtu"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_rndn8"]
script = ExtResource("10_5urhh")
aspect_type = ExtResource("13_fp7ll")
min_count = 2
extra_per_season = 1

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_nbfrc"]
script = ExtResource("6_7yudu")
markedup_text = "Look through her mother's book."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_rndn8")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_aqvio")
markedup_result_text = "The woman looks from the cat to the bottle on the shelf, realizing she must have taken the wrong kind of medicine.

Intent on learning what it is she has imbibed, she leafs through the worn and smudged pages of her mother's recipe book.

Maybe if she combined that potion with a few drops of…

Soon, her mind is buzzing with ideas. Inspired, she spends the rest of the night working out a new tincture."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_twrtr"]
script = ExtResource("8_ryqc6")
card_type = ExtResource("14_oo52i")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cqnoecri6xisf"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_c8ask"]
script = ExtResource("10_5urhh")
aspect_type = ExtResource("15_nro24")
min_count = 4
extra_per_season = 1

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_hyddf"]
script = ExtResource("6_7yudu")
markedup_text = "Get some fresh air."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_c8ask")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_twrtr")
markedup_result_text = "Longing to feel the wind on her face and the ground beneath her feet, the apothecary puts on a heavier robe and leaves the cat at the warm hearth.

She looks up at the dark sky, the clouds low and heavy. Frogs croak in the distance as rain washes down her face.

She stands there for a long while, slowly regaining a sense of inner peace."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_uh44u"]
script = ExtResource("6_7yudu")
markedup_text = "Wait until morning."
markedup_result_text = "The apothecary decides to pretend that nothing is wrong.

She sits up straight in her chair and pours herself some tea. She ignores the cat's commentary, which becomes increasingly rude.

If she can remain calm, maybe the strange effects will pass by morning."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_aub3o"]
script = ExtResource("4_rmdpv")
markedup_text = "Lantern light burns dimly across the dark water outside the apothecary's hut, hidden by reeds that almost reach above the roof.

The young apothecary, working late into the night, is nursing a persistent cough. Luckily, when she inherited the job, with it came shelves full of medicines, bundled herbs, and jars of bitter powders.

As the night wears on, her cough fades, but the room begins to tilt. The black cat lounging beside the hearth blinks at her, its eyes narrowing.

\"Good evening,\" it says."
